@startuml
actor Human
participant Developer
participant "AEO-3 Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "QA / Security / Architect / Writer" as Review
participant "Quality Engine" as Quality
participant "Sandboxed Validators" as Validators
database "Evidence Store" as Store
Human -> Quality : activate reviewed policy
Developer -> Scheduler : implementation execution completes
Scheduler -> Review : approved independent read-only reviews
Review --> Scheduler : advisory findings
Human -> Quality : validate milestone
Quality -> Validators : execute required allowlisted checks
Validators --> Quality : deterministic output and exit status
Quality -> Store : immutable raw evidence and results
Quality -> Quality : verify acceptance mappings and freshness
Quality --> Human : READY_FOR_APPROVAL or blockers
@enduml
